  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How to reconcile multiple transactions\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 20 Jul, 2021 at  4:43 PM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nBank >> Dashboard >> Select bank account >> Find transaction >> Click on 'Select Action' >> Click on 'Multiple Transaction' >> Create multiple receipts / journals as required\n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to reconcile multiple transactions \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nUsing the navigation panel on the left to go into the bank dashboard \n\nSelect a bank account and then use the search function to find the transaction that needs to be reconciled.\n\nClick on the 'Select Action' drop box and select 'Multiple Transaction'. \n\nYou can then choose how you to reconcile the transaction.\n\nYou can either choose to create multiple receipts / payments for one transaction as shown below:\n\nOr you can choose to create a journal entry:\n\nThis will give you the abililty to split the transaction and choose how it needs to be reconciled.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to reconcile multiple transactions\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 20 Jul, 2021 at  4:43 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Location:</u></strong><br><br>Bank &gt;&gt; Dashboard &gt;&gt; Select bank account &gt;&gt; Find transaction &gt;&gt; Click on 'Select Action' &gt;&gt; Click on 'Multiple Transaction' &gt;&gt; Create multiple receipts / journals as required<br><br><strong><u>Video Tutorial:</u></strong><br><br><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/af57aba1975e42d68cc6fd32ae819dac\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to reconcile multiple transactions&nbsp;</a><br><br><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Help Guide:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Using the navigation panel on the left to go into the bank dashboard&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134665665/original/PionFkyMg9WTILMTbIvDiKFr_Z2WQjlF1w.png?1626359358\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134665665\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Select a bank account and then use the search function to find the transaction that needs to be reconciled.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134666421/original/yMlt_COMHptKfKSAd0I6BSnC4Pqen8F8-w.png?1626359571\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134666421\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Click on the 'Select Action' drop box and select 'Multiple Transaction'.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134666607/original/ulk78M9qFlV7zfUPtOOVEh3fGb7v2qBqVQ.png?1626359652\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134666607\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can then choose how you to reconcile the transaction.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can either choose to create multiple receipts / payments for one transaction as shown below:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134669003/original/cCDtln50d7G0MDQn31GyRx8z5-nv8OnVVw.gif?1626360563\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134669003\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Or you can choose to create a journal entry:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9134669581/original/qGx0_MdLe6ZBjlSnAnRDAYHc9LJe6WOLsw.gif?1626360784\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9134669581\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">This will give you the abililty to split the transaction and choose how it needs to be reconciled.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204503\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204503/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204503\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204503/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204503\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container